**POST /api/v1/memos**

Defined by the `google.api.http` annotation on the RPC in `proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-25`:

```
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
```

The request body binds to the `memo` field of `CreateMemoRequest` (`proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:293-300`), and the server-side implementation is `APIV1Service.CreateMemo` at `server/router/api/v1/memo_service.go:70`, exposed over Connect via `ConnectServiceHandler.CreateMemo` (`server/router/api/v1/connect_services.go:306`).
